					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I like this one. It has a bit of a sad note at the end, but it still feels like WWS's upbeat, even <em>cheerful</em> take on anomalous critters. That tension, combined with the fact that Sampson's history is rather mysterious, dangles in just enough interest to keep things, well, interesting.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
